 bne COLD15 If not, end of ram
 ldx #$FF00 Try a different pattern
 stx 0,Y Store it
 cmpx 0,Y Did it take?
 bne COLD15 If not, done
 stu 0,Y Replace current value
 bra COLD17
COLD15 ldb #$80
COLD16 stb [,S] Mark end of block map (Fake 1MB)
COLD17 puls X Get block map pointer
 leax 1,X Next
