*
* Is module's DAT present in process DAT?
*
* Entry:
*   Module block count in B
*   Module DAT image pointer in Y
*   Module DAT image pointer in U
*
* Exit:
*   DAT index in process of match in B
*   Carry set if no match
*

ISMAPD ldx <D.Proc Get proc ptr
 leay P$DATImg,X Get process DAT img ptr
 clra
 pshs Y,X,D
 subb #DAT.BlCt
 negb Get highest search spot
 aslb
 leay B,Y point Y to process DAT search

ISMAPD1 ldx ,S Get block count
 pshs U,Y
ISMAPD2 ldd ,Y++ Does process DAT
 cmpd ,U++ match module DAT?
 bne NOTMAPD no; try another search
 leax -1,X Check all blocks
 bne ISMAPD2

* Found a match
 puls D,U Get adjusted DAT ptr and unadjusted DAT ptr
 subd 4,S Adjusted - unadjusted
 lsrb DAT index in process of match
 stb ,S
 clrb Success
 puls D,X,Y,PC

* Mismatch
NOTMAPD puls Y,U
 leay -2,Y Try for match earlier in DAT
 cmpy 4,S Out of places to start?
 bcc ISMAPD1 no; try again
 puls D,X,Y,PC No match
 
