SRQMEM ldd R$D,U Get byte count
 addd #$FF Round up to page
 clrb
 std R$D,U Return size to user

* Build memory block map for entire 64K space
* A free DAT block has all pages set to free

 ldy D.SysMem Get sys mem map ptr
 leas -2,S Temp
 stb ,S First block

SRQM10 ldx D.SysDAT Get system DAT
 aslb Block count to DAT offset
 ldd B,X Get current DAT block
 cmpd #DAT.Free unused?
 beq ALLFREE yes; all pages available
 ldx D.BlkMap
